{"obsah":"<p><strong><br>10/7 – Movomal 2021 exhibition – Mariánské Lázně</strong></p>\n\n<p>A beautiful day, a big event and female company too. The ideal weekend exhibition right in the centre of Mariánské Lázně at Movomal 2021, the first event held after Covid-19. Lukáš Valný came along with Vlasta, and in two shows on our trailer they showed a few hundred spectators what can be done on a bike. The organisers praised us, and the spectators' reactions made it clear they were enjoying the day and the show. The only pity was that we couldn't stay for the afternoon too, but the wedding of Petr Jeřicha from our team and club simply took priority.</p>\n\n<p><strong>12–16/7 – Organising a bike day camp – Tehov</strong></p>\n\n<p>The second edition of our bike day camps, created under the banner of our club and the Bikeskills.cz project, will run in two sessions this time. The first July session is behind us, again with plenty of bike-hungry girls and boys who did nothing all day but fly around on bikes on the jumps, the pump track or on rides around the area. The rain complicated things a bit, but in the end it didn't turn out badly and the rain always stopped within a few hours. We also had alternative food in the form of flavoured gummy worms, and there were chess tournaments too.</p>\n\n<p><strong>17/7 – Dolánky festival exhibition – Dolánky near Turnov</strong><strong></strong></p>\n\n<p>We always look forward to a show with our legendary member Martin Šimůnek. The line-up was strong, we brought two trailers of obstacles and prepared a workshop. In the end it rained so much that we didn't even get the bikes out of the car, and we were glad the organiser let us go home, because the whole Liberec region was completely under water. It was probably the first exhibition where we didn't ride at all because of rain :( Hopefully we'll get a chance to show what we can do in slightly better conditions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>19/7 – LSK days – Prague</strong></p>\n\n<p>After his vaccination, but with the prospect of testing the Jahodnice bike park, Vlasta headed to the open days of Levelsportkoncept, which he has been working with for… well, a long time. The importer of POC, MALOJA, Lezyne, DVO and many other exclusive brands invites its employees and partners to a reception. Unfortunately Vlasta only had time for one day, so a test of Jahodnice was arranged, which was built by Michal Maroši, another LSK rider. There was playing around on the skills centre, the pump track was tested and a few attempts on the jumps too. Thanks for the invitation – we look forward to the next ride.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2F6404c5dd-2b38-48b4-8467-2871f210d5ef.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2F6404c5dd-2b38-48b4-8467-2871f210d5ef.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"192896\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2F6404c5dd-2b38-48b4-8467-2871f210d5ef.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=192896\" class=\"wp-image-192896\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2Fc81e1fce-bf63-4f01-bd11-89a5eb4172df.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2Fc81e1fce-bf63-4f01-bd11-89a5eb4172df.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"192897\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F07%2Fc81e1fce-